0..58 Comment "// This source defines theories and rules of global state."
59..61 Comment "//"
62..136 Comment "// `get` passes state to its continuation. `put` replaces state before its"
137..153 Comment "// continuation."
154..230 Comment "// The laws are the global-state rules of § 2.1 of the cited work. The path"
231..258 Comment "// order orients each rule."
259..261 Comment "//"
262..338 Comment "// The checker tests overlaps between the state rules. Each overlap joins in"
339..367 Comment "// the second-order reading."
368..370 Comment "//"
371..443 Comment "// Limits: the checker refuses the law `getPut` beside these laws in the"
444..465 Comment "// pathological twin."
466..468 Comment "//"
469..518 Comment "// - see: #2116 — `StatePutLaws`, `StateGetGet`"
519..550 Comment "// - see: #1934 — `StateLaws`"
551..630 Comment "// - see: `../specification/state-wp.gandr` — a state-passing handler checked"
631..655 Comment "//   against `StateLaws`"
656..735 Comment "// - cites: [e.k.Cooper-2023-marriage_effects_rewrites], § 2.1 — the laws of"
736..753 Comment "//   global state"
754..756 Comment "//"
757..884 Comment "// [e.k.Cooper-2023-marriage_effects_rewrites]: https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.02462 \"Cooper, The marriage of effects and rewrites\""
